  "source": "# The storeroom\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/scene-dark-room.md`, then edited by it without its grid\n  (`game-storeroom-nogrid.md`).\n- The dark bands round it painted by Gemini from `game-storeroom-voids.md`,\n  joined by `tools/art/repaint.py`, and what still was dark tiled from its\n  own stones (`tiled`).\n- The key taken out by `tools/art/repaint.py fill`, and cut by the polygon\n  traced round it.\n- The hole of the slab painted by Gemini from `game-storeroom-hole.md`, and laid\n  at its cell's size by `tools/art/repaint.py placed`.\n- The door opened by `tools/art/door.py` from the painting itself, no model asked.\n",
